# [SONNET-4.6] sq-3x7dl.14.2: the harness lock is deliberately NOT committed.
#
# This is a DETACHED cargo project whose deps are in-repo path deps (sparq-engine ->
# sparq-core -> …). Those manifests bump on lanes that never run this harness, so a
# committed lock drifts silently on main and would fail an innocent PR — the sq-q134e
# lesson from bench/zk-compose/family_curve. The driver script correspondingly does NOT
# pass --locked. Reproducibility of the ORACLE comes from the pinned workspace deps the
# path crates already carry, not from a second lock here.
Cargo.lock

# (zk/.gitignore already covers target/.)
